WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.849
A tarot deck has four suits, each linked
to an element and an area of life.

00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:08.886
Knowing them helps you read a spread at a
glance.

00:00:10.186 --> 00:00:11.056
Wands: fire.

00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:15.552
Wands are linked with fire, and with
energy, drive and action.

00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:22.585
Wands cards often speak about enthusiasm, ambition,
creativity and the way you spend your effort.

00:00:23.885 --> 00:00:24.702
Cups: water.

00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:28.516
Cups belong to water, and to feelings and
relationships.

00:00:28.516 --> 00:00:34.508
They cover love, friendship, family, intuition,
nostalgia and emotional life in general.

00:00:35.908 --> 00:00:38.263
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:38.263 --> 00:00:43.037
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
